<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9735" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cōnāmen</span></b> ,
		ĭnis, n.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an
				effort, exertion, struggle</i> (<b>poet.</b>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					6, 836</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eundi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 6,
					326</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">magno conamine,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					3, 60</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. ib. 8, 366</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. F. 4,
				325</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Luc. 4, 287</span></i>.—In
				plur.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conamina mortis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 10, 390</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Lucr. 6, 1040</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Concr., <i>a support,
				prop</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">constitit (infans), adjutis aliquo conamine
					nervis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 15, 224</span></i>
			.</div>
